  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {認知|にんち}{症|しょう}: dementia (lit. 'cognition illness')\n- {認知|にんち}{機能|きのう}: cognitive function\n- {認知|にんち}{度|ど}: level of recognition/awareness\n- {認知|にんち}バイアス: cognitive bias\n- {認知|にんち}{科学|かがく}: cognitive science\n\nUSAGE:\nIn everyday Japanese, {認知|にんち}{症|しょう} (dementia) is by far the most common compound. The word {認知|にんち}{度|ど} is frequently used in marketing and media to mean 'brand awareness' or 'recognition level.' The legal sense (acknowledging paternity) is specific to family law but appears in news and dramas.",
